              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Leslie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have not tried adding onions, but another variation is to thinly slice fresh brussels sprouts (I use a food processor) and then stir fry rather than saute with the olive oil and garlic. You can also drizzle in some teriyaki for a more oriental flavor."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
