            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Godsgood"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The garlic cooks much faster than 3 minutes, and I'd add the Brussels sprouts earlier. Also, covering the pan with a lid helps them cook through faster. I left out the garlic powder - it was delicious enough as it is (fresh garlic - so much better).",
